#==============================================================================================
#
#   fetching_7 - Fetch::Fetching: the network fetch through the ResourceLoader, CORS-preflight
#   fetch, the Fetch metadata headers and the memory cache switch
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Fetching/Fetching.cpp (lines 2072-2545): the debug log
#       of a load (WEB_FETCH_DEBUG), Ladybird's non-standard drop-in for HTTP-network fetch
#       (it also serves file:, resource: and about: URLs through the ResourceLoader: a
#       ReadableStream with byte reading support fed by a FetchedDataReceiver), CORS-preflight
#       fetch, setting the Sec-Fetch-Dest, -Mode, -Site and -User headers, and enabling and
#       clearing the HTTP memory cache. Each C++ lambda is a capture struct with a static
#       function (DESIGN.md §2.7).
